        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Total frekuensi $n = 20$. Hitung $Q_1$ dan $Q_3$ terlebih dahulu:" },
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "1. Letak $Q_1$ = data ke-$\\frac{20}{4} = 5$ (kelas 6–10, $T_b = 5{,}5$, $p = 5$, $F_k = 2$, $f = 5$):\n$$Q_1 = 5{,}5 + 5 \\left( \\dfrac{5 - 2}{5} \\right) = 8{,}5$$" },
